---
args: { check: EstimandCheck, output: ApprovedAnalysisOutput, accounts: EvidencePage[] }
returns: FeedbackReview
---
If approval, estimand alignment, or measurement-window checks block the output, return a withheld review naming those blockers and do not fit qualitative accounts to an unapproved quantitative claim. Otherwise search for dissatisfied users who succeeded and satisfied users who failed; retain both supporting and contrary accounts, specify a rival explanation and discriminating observation, and never treat the account sample as causal proof.
